# 交流与反馈 / Feedback and discussion

欢迎在 [Issues](https://github.com/Korhii/MI-HDR-Control/issues) 指出错误，在 [Discussions](https://github.com/Korhii/MI-HDR-Control/discussions) 交流使用体验和参数，也可通过 Pull Requests 提交改动。项目主要自用，作者并非专业开发者；不承诺回复、维护、更新、修复 bug 或合并提交。

反馈时尽量写明软件版本、显示器型号/固件、操作步骤和实际现象。截图或日志请遮挡账号、IP、Wi-Fi 名、序列号和密钥；设备备份、厂商固件及个人配置不要上传。

Issues, Discussions and pull requests are open for errors, experiences, parameter questions and proposed changes. This is a personal-use experiment by a non-professional developer. Replies, maintenance, updates, fixes and merges are not promised. Include relevant versions, steps and observations where possible. Mask private identifiers and keys; keep device backups, firmware and personal configuration out of public submissions.

## AI 工具 / AI tools

本项目的开发、调试与文档整理使用了 AI 工具。生成内容可能有误，功能和测试范围以项目记录为准。

AI tools assisted development, debugging and documentation. Generated content may contain errors; project records define the functionality and tested scope.
